repository-code: 'https://github.com/McNamara84/ernie'
url: 'https://gfz.de'
abstract: >-
  ERNIE is a metadata curation and publishing system for
  research datasets at GFZ Helmholtz Centre for Geosciences.
  It supports DataCite Metadata Schema v4.7 for DOI
  registration, IGSN registration for physical samples,
  public landing pages for published records, and a search
  portal for curated datasets.
